    "created_at": "2023-07-10T20:57:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-10T20:59:26Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure what PEG is, but it's highly unlikely we'll change the URL parser, especially so drastically. The motivation is also somewhat hard to digest and not necessarily convincing, as browsers have adopted UDP for HTTP without a need for a change in scheme.\r\n\r\nhttps://whatwg.org/faq#adding-new-features might help in presenting this in a clearer way. And https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes lists the requirements for an actual change.",
